Defect: SMI-UNPUBLISHED-MODULE https://pysnmp.github.io/pysmi/stable/mib-defects.html#smi-unpublished-module

The module imports igmpInterfaceEntry FROM IGMP-MIB. No publisher ships
a module by that name: RFC 2933 publishes the IGMP MIB as IGMP-STD-MIB,
which is what defines igmpInterfaceEntry and what this corpus carries.

The repair is the published spelling.

--- a/CISCO-IPMCAST-MIB
+++ b/CISCO-IPMCAST-MIB
@@ -9,7 +9,7 @@
         RowStatus, TruthValue            FROM SNMPv2-TC
         OwnerString                      FROM RFC1271-MIB
         MODULE-COMPLIANCE, OBJECT-GROUP  FROM SNMPv2-CONF
-        igmpInterfaceEntry               FROM IGMP-MIB;
+        igmpInterfaceEntry               FROM IGMP-STD-MIB;
 
     ciscoMcastMIB MODULE-IDENTITY
         LAST-UPDATED "9407301359Z"
